d\",\"verification_method\":\"T\",\"proposed_verification_fixture\":\"Reconstruct two revisions after a change and compare their manifests and contents. Attempted overwrite cannot erase the retained prior baseline.\",\"implementation_gap\":\"Protect retention, prevent rewrite/delete through policy, and test full restoration including binary/environment dependencies.\",\"boundary_authority_note\":\"Framework retains baseline custody even on a managed host. Storage administrator cannot silently redefine a domain baseline.\",\"interface_family_ids\":[\"IF-06\"],\"execution_host_ids\":[\"GY-H1\",\"GY-H2\",\"GY-H3\"],\"storage_host_ids\":[\"GY-H2\"],\"procedure_performer\":\"Systems Engineer or delegated configuration custodian\",\"design_coverage\":\"specific intended realization with explicit implementation gap\",\"verified_satisfaction\":false,\"verified_eligibility\":false}"; status = "proposed comparison description, not implemented or verified"; }
