vision checks. Retain unsupported mappings and development gaps. A missing required profile remains not verified or undetermined and cannot pass V18. A narrower minimum requires a reviewed scope disposition before evaluation.\",\"implementation_gap\":\"LTspice/COMSOL/Simulink profiles and CAD tool/export profile require access, implementation and transfer tests. No bidirectional native model adapter is demonstrated.\",\"boundary_authority_note\":\"IF-03 specialist services are external except integrated C25 battery runtime. Each native/YAML field has one declared authority.\",\"interface_family_ids\":[\"IF-03\",\"IF-04\"],\"execution_host_ids\":[\"GY-H1\",\"GY-H3\"],\"storage_host_ids\":[\"GY-H2\"],\"procedure_performer\":\"EPS Engineer and Non-EPS flight/ground engineers\",\"design_coverage\":\"specific intended realization with explicit implementation gap\",\"verified_satisfaction\":false,\"verified_eligibility\":false}"; status = "proposed comparison description, not implemented or verified"; }
