ovement. Retain pending SIL, HIL or hardware evidence.\",\"implementation_gap\":\"Implement controller/plant fixtures and agreed policy measures. Safe or improved hardware performance is unverified.\",\"boundary_authority_note\":\"Controller code is an engineered artifact registered for SIL. Policy results never authorize physical charging or autonomous actuation.\",\"interface_family_ids\":[\"IF-01\",\"IF-03\"],\"execution_host_ids\":[\"GY-H1\",\"GY-H3\"],\"storage_host_ids\":[\"GY-H2\"],\"procedure_performer\":\"EPS Engineer or designated analysis operator, independent reproducer for replay\",\"design_coverage\":\"specific intended realization with explicit implementation gap\",\"verified_satisfaction\":false,\"verified_eligibility\":false}"; status = "proposed comparison description, not implemented or verified"; }
